su name hymn source thrust checked to name text pass be ceremony def
  su name hymn source thrust write stage ob name text hymn source thrust request for name hymn source thrust verify mind to name text hymn source thrust review by num 0 atmost num 280 be write do
  su name hymn source thrust verdict tail stage ob name text hymn source thrust review atmost num 1 to name text hymn source thrust verdict line be line tail do
  ob text "" to name text hymn source thrust verdict be text do
  ob text "false" to name text hymn source thrust pass be text do
  ob name text hymn source thrust review from text "/\\bPASS\\s*$/i" be resemble then
  ob text "PASS" to name text hymn source thrust verdict be text do
  ob name text hymn source thrust review from text "/\\bPASS\\s*$/i" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text hymn source thrust pass be text do
  ob name text hymn source thrust review from text "/\\bFAIL\\s*$/i" be resemble then
  ob text "FAIL" to name text hymn source thrust verdict be text do
  ob name text hymn source thrust verdict be equally from text "" then
  su name hymn source thrust verdict request begin stage ob text "VERIFIER_ANALYSIS:\n" to name text hymn source thrust verdict request be text do
  ob name text hymn source thrust review to name text hymn source thrust verdict request be plus do
  ob name text hymn source thrust verdict request for name hymn source thrust verdict mind to name text hymn source thrust verdict raw by num 0 atmost num 8 be write do
  ob name text hymn source thrust verdict raw atmost num 1 to name text hymn source thrust verdict line be line tail do
  ob name text hymn source thrust verdict line from text "/^\\s*PASS\\b/i" be resemble then
  ob text "PASS" to name text hymn source thrust verdict be text do
  ob name text hymn source thrust verdict line from text "/^\\s*PASS\\b/i" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text hymn source thrust pass be text do
  ob name text hymn source thrust verdict line from text "/^\\s*FAIL\\b/i" be resemble then
  ob text "FAIL" to name text hymn source thrust verdict be text do
  ob name text hymn source thrust verdict be equally from text "" then
  su name hymn source thrust verdict guarantee stage ob bool lie fromtext text "hymn source thrust verdict defective" be guarantee do
  su name hymn source thrust pass ret
prah

